{"id":"1634e72112a69435759336cb363daac6d35956bc","axis":"silent","repo":"TYPO3/typo3","sha":"1634e72112a69435759336cb363daac6d35956bc","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"typo3/sysext/core/Configuration/DefaultConfiguration.php","lines":["@@ -99,6 +99,7 @@","         ],","         'fileCreateMask' => '0664',","         'folderCreateMask' => '2775',","+        'isInstalling' => false,","         'features' => [","             'extbase.enableHistoryTracking' => false,","             'frontend.cache.autoTagging' => false,"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/core/Documentation/Changelog/13.4.x/Important-110955-NewIsInstallingSystemSetting.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@","+..  include:: /Includes.rst.txt","+","+..  _important-110955-1791395981:","+","+=============================================================","+Important: #110955 - New global system setting \"isInstalling\"","+=============================================================","+","+See :issue:`110955`","+","+Description","+===========","+","+A new global boolean configuration option","+:php:`$GLOBALS['TYPO3_CONF_VARS']['SYS']['isInstalling']` has been introduced.","+It indicates whether a first installation is currently in progress and controls","+whether the TYPO3 installer (the first-install wizard, not the Install Tool /","+Admin Tools) may run on an instance that already has a","+:file:`config/system/settings.php`.","+","+The installer is now only reachable when one of the following is true:","+","+*   no :file:`settings.php` exists yet (a brand-new instance), or","+*   :php:`SYS/isInstalling` is set to :php:`true`.","+","+The value defaults to :php:`false`. A fresh installation automatically sets it to","+:php:`true` while the wizard runs and back to :php:`false` once the installation is","+finished. Instances upgraded from a TYPO3 version that did not yet know this","+option are treated as not installing, so the installer is not reachable for them.","+","+As a consequence, placing a :php:`FIRST_INSTALL` marker file in the public web root","+no longer re-opens the installer on an already configured instance. If you","+intentionally need to (re-)run the installer on an instance that still has a","+:file:`settings.php` (for example when re-provisioning), set","+:php:`SYS/isInstalling` to :php:`true` in :file:`settings.php` first. Changing this","+value requires file system access and can therefore not be triggered through the","+web.","+","+..  index:: LocalConfiguration, ext:install"],"additions":39,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/install/Classes/Command/SetupCommand.php","lines":["@@ -313,6 +313,7 @@ protected function execute(InputInterface $input, OutputInterface $output): int","         $setupDatabaseService->markWizardsDone($container);","         Bootstrap::initializeBackendAuthentication();","         $this->setupService->setupExtensions($container);","+        $this->setupService->markInstallationFinished();","         $this->writeSuccess($output, 'Congratulations - TYPO3 Setup is done.');"," ","         return Command::SUCCESS;"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/install/Classes/Controller/InstallerController.php","lines":["@@ -617,6 +617,7 @@ public function executeDefaultConfigurationAction(ServerRequestInterface $reques","         $formProtection = $this->formProtectionFactory->createFromRequest($request);","         $formProtection->clean();"," ","+        $this->setupService->markInstallationFinished();","         EnableFileService::removeFirstInstallFile();"," ","         return new JsonResponse(["],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/install/Classes/Middleware/Installer.php","lines":["@@ -128,7 +128,7 @@ public function process(ServerRequestInterface $request, RequestHandlerInterface"," ","     /**","      * First installation is in progress, if system/settings.php does not exist,","-     * or if FIRST_INSTALL file exists.","+     * or if the FIRST_INSTALL file exists and the SYS/isInstalling flag is `true`.","      */","     protected function canHandleRequest(): bool","     {"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/install/Classes/Service/EnableFileService.php","lines":["@@ -15,7 +15,9 @@"," "," namespace TYPO3\\CMS\\Install\\Service;"," ","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Configuration\\ConfigurationManager;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Core\\Environment;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Utility\\Exception\\MissingArrayPathException;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Utility\\GeneralUtility;"," "," /**","@@ -39,13 +41,28 @@ class EnableFileService","      */","     public const INSTALL_TOOL_ENABLE_FILE_LIFETIME = 3600;"," ","+    /**","+     * A first install is allowed when a FIRST_INSTALL marker file exists and the","+     * instance is not yet installed: either no settings.php exists at all, or a","+     * fresh installation is currently running (SYS/isInstalling). This makes sure a","+     * marker file dropped into the public web root cannot re-open the installer on an","+     * already configured instance. A missing flag (instance upgraded from a version","+     * without it, or a finished installation) is treated as \"not installing\".","+     */","     public static function isFirstInstallAllowed(): bool","     {","-        $files = self::getFirstInstallFilePaths();","-        if (!empty($files)) {","+        if (empty(self::getFirstInstallFilePaths())) {","+            return false;","+        }","+        $configurationManager = new ConfigurationManager();","+        if (!@is_file($configurationManager->getSystemConfigurationFileLocation())) {","             return true;","         }","-        return false;","+        try {","+            return (bool)$configurationManager->getLocalConfigurationValueByPath('SYS/isInstalling');","+        } catch (MissingArrayPathException) {","+            return false;","+        }","     }"," ","     /**","@@ -211,21 +228,26 @@ protected static function getInstallToolEnableFilePath(): string","      */","     protected static function getFirstInstallFilePaths(): array","     {","+        $isFirstInstallFile = static fn(string $file): bool","+            => strcasecmp($file, self::FIRST_INSTALL_FILE_PATH) === 0","+            || strcasecmp($file, self::FIRST_INSTALL_FILE_PATH . '.txt') === 0;","         // Check in public path","         $files = scandir(Environment::getPublicPath() . '/');","         $files = is_array($files) ? $files : [];","-        $files = array_filter($files, static function ($file) {","-            return @is_file(Environment::getPublicPath() . '/' . $file) && preg_match('~^' . self::FIRST_INSTALL_FILE_PATH . '.*~i', $file);","-        });","+        $files = array_filter(","+            $files,","+            static fn(string $file): bool => @is_file(Environment::getPublicPath() . '/' . $file) && $isFirstInstallFile($file)","+        );","         $files = array_map(fn(string $file): string => Environment::getPublicPath() . '/' . $file, $files);"," ","         // Check in project path (only if different from public path)","         if (Environment::getPublicPath() !== Environment::getProjectPath()) {","             $projectFiles = scandir(Environment::getProjectPath() . '/');","             $projectFiles = is_array($projectFiles) ? $projectFiles : [];","-            $projectFiles = array_filter($projectFiles, static function ($file) {","-                return @is_file(Environment::getProjectPath() . '/' . $file) && preg_match('~^' . self::FIRST_INSTALL_FILE_PATH . '.*~i', $file);","-            });","+            $projectFiles = array_filter(","+                $projectFiles,","+                static fn(string $file): bool => @is_file(Environment::getProjectPath() . '/' . $file) && $isFirstInstallFile($file)","+            );","             $projectFiles = array_map(fn(string $file): string => Environment::getProjectPath() . '/' . $file, $projectFiles);","             $files = array_unique(array_merge($files, $projectFiles));","         }"],"additions":31,"deletions":9,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/install/Classes/Service/SetupService.php","lines":["@@ -203,6 +203,15 @@ public function setInstallToolPassword(string $password): bool","         ]);","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * Clears the in-progress flag set by prepareSystemSettings(), so the installer","+     * can no longer run on this instance.","+     */","+    public function markInstallationFinished(): void","+    {","+        $this->configurationManager->setLocalConfigurationValueByPath('SYS/isInstalling', false);","+    }","+","     /**","      * @throws ConfigurationFileAlreadyExistsException","      * @throws ConfigurationDirectoryDoesNotExistException","@@ -231,6 +240,9 @@ public function prepareSystemSettings(bool $forceOverwrite = false): void","         $this->configurationManager->setLocalConfigurationValueByPath('SYS/encryptionKey', $randomKey);","         $GLOBALS['TYPO3_CONF_VARS']['SYS']['encryptionKey'] = $randomKey;"," ","+        // Mark this fresh installation as in progress.","+        $this->configurationManager->setLocalConfigurationValueByPath('SYS/isInstalling', true);","+","         // Get best matching configuration presets","         $featureManager = new FeatureManager();","         $configurationValues = $featureManager->getBestMatchingConfigurationForAllFeatures();",""],"additions":12,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":86,"deletions":10,"truncated":false,"file_count":7},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-17T18:45:59.492821+00:00"}